From 9f07d81429ce5a787c7094acaf7165c8e8675e71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sarangbhagwat <sarangbhagwat.developer@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:13:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Port succinic biorefineries (and the cellulosic/corn parts
 they use) to BioSTEAM 2.54 / thermosteam 0.54.2

- succinic/units.py: import StirredTankReactor from
  biosteam.units.abstract_stirred_tank_reactor when it is no longer exported
  by biosteam.units.
- succinic/system_*.py: call the succinic SystemFactory with autorename=False;
  biosteam >= 2.53 autorenames objects with duplicate IDs by default (e.g. the
  two 'dilution_water' streams, the two 'S301' units), which broke flowsheet
  lookups. autorename=False restores the original replace-in-registry behavior.
- succinic/__init__.py: runtime replacement of thermosteam.utils.trim_cache,
  which iterates over an int (`for i in 20`) and raises TypeError once an
  indexer cache exceeds 200 keys (reached by the succinic systems).
- succinic/_process_specification.py (load_yield): bug fix for yields above
  1 - pyruvic acid yield - cell mass yield: the xylose cell-mass conversion was
  written to glucose_to_microbe_rxn and cell-mass conversions were left stale
  when the pyruvic acid yield remained > 0. No effect for yields below that
  (i.e. the publication's TRY domain at baseline cell mass yield).
- cellulosic create_facilities: FireWaterTank has no inlet in biosteam >= 2.53
  (flow given by fire_water_flow_rate), and CoolingTower outlets changed
  (blowdown is now outs[0]); use CT.blowdown_water where CT-1 (blowdown) was
  used before.
- corn/units.py: SimultaneousSaccharificationFermentation keeps 2 inlets
  (biosteam 2.53.8 reduced BatchBioreactor._N_ins to 1).

Process assumptions and values are unchanged.

